00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:18.480
>> If there is a single human being

00:00:16.160 --> 00:00:22.000
that could make one decision

00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:23.400
and negatively impact your life

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:24.960
you don't have leverage.

00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:27.480
>> Mhm.

00:00:24.960 --> 00:00:29.560
>> For 95% of people that's a boss.

00:00:27.480 --> 00:00:31.680
