00:00:56.800 --> 00:00:59.960
so that eventually if you actually have

00:00:58.680 --> 00:01:02.080
ultimate leverage is that there's not a

00:00:59.960 --> 00:01:04.559
single one person. There's not a single

00:01:02.080 --> 00:01:07.480
one person in the world who can make a

00:01:04.559 --> 00:01:08.680
