00:01:07.480 --> 00:01:10.480
ability

00:01:08.680 --> 00:01:12.800
to cover your bills, build wealth, and

00:01:10.480 --> 00:01:14.240
feed your family.

00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:18.600
That's what leverage is.

